---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title={"Sekretaris Jenderal — TIDAR"} description={"Biodata Rocky Candra, S.E."} bodyClass={"inner-page leader-page logo-page"} extraCss={["/pages.css"]}>
<main id="main"><section aria-labelledby="mlHeroTitle" class="ml-hero">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-shape">
<svg focusable="false" preserveaspectratio="none" viewbox="0 0 1600 560">
<defs>
<lineargradient id="mlHeroRedGradient" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1">
<stop offset="0" stop-color="#ef101c"></stop>
<stop offset="0.48" stop-color="#e20d19"></stop>
<stop offset="1" stop-color="#c80712"></stop>
</lineargradient>
<pattern height="22" id="mlHeroDotPattern" patternunits="userSpaceOnUse" width="22">
<circle cx="3" cy="3" fill="#ffffff" fill-opacity="0.14" r="1.7"></circle>
</pattern>
</defs>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-red" d="M0 0H1145C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560H0Z" fill="url(#mlHeroRedGradient)"></path>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-dots" d="M0 0H1145C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560H0Z" fill="url(#mlHeroDotPattern)"></path>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-edge" d="M1145 0C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560" fill="none"></path>
</svg>
</div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-ribbons"></div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-dots"></div>
<div class="ml-hero-inner">
<div class="ml-hero-copy">
<p class="ml-eyebrow">Profil Pimpinan</p>
<h1 class="ml-hero-title" id="mlHeroTitle"><span>Sekretaris</span><span>Jenderal</span></h1>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-rule"></div>
<p class="ml-hero-lead">Biodata, pengalaman, dan kontribusi pimpinan Pengurus Pusat TIDAR.</p>
</div>
<figure class="ml-garuda-panel">
<img alt="Garuda Pancasila, lambang negara Republik Indonesia" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="1042" src="/assets/garuda-pancasila-authentic.webp" width="960"/>
<figcaption class="ml-garuda-caption"><span>Lambang Negara</span><span>Republik Indonesia</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</section><section class="content-section content-section--paper"><div class="container leader-profile leader-profile--premium"><div class="leader-photo"><img alt="Rocky Candra, S.E." decoding="async" loading="eager" src="/assets/ROCKY-CHANDRA-1.png"/><div class="leader-badge"><span>Pengurus Pusat TIDAR</span><strong>Sekretaris Jenderal PP TIDAR</strong></div></div><div class="leader-copy"><p class="section-kicker">Profil Pimpinan</p><h2>Rocky Candra, S.E.</h2><div aria-label="Biodata singkat" class="leader-bio-summary"><span></span><p>Rocky Candra merupakan politikus dan Anggota DPR RI dari Daerah Pemilihan Jambi. Sebagai anggota Komisi XII dan Badan Legislasi DPR RI, ia berfokus pada isu energi, lingkungan hidup, investasi, serta pembangunan yang memberikan manfaat langsung bagi masyarakat.</p></div><div class="bio-facts"><div class="bio-fact"><small>Tempat, tanggal lahir</small><strong>12 Mei 1987, Bandar Lampung</strong></div><div class="bio-fact"><small>Pendidikan formal</small><strong>Sarjana Ekonomi, STIE Rahmaniyah Sekayu</strong></div></div><section aria-label="Lebih dekat dengan profil pimpinan" class="leader-fun-facts">
<header><p class="section-kicker">Lebih Dekat</p></header>
<div class="fun-fact-grid"><article class="fun-fact-card"><span aria-hidden="true" class="fun-fact-icon">★</span><div><p>Rocky Candra adalah Anggota Komisi XII DPR RI dari daerah pemilihan Jambi.</p><a href="https://emedia.dpr.go.id/2025/06/24/komitmen-dukung-pembangunan-ebt-rocky-candra-elektrifikasi-di-jambi-harus-sampai-dusun/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Sumber: DPR RI <svg aria-hidden="true" class="external-arrow" focusable="false" viewbox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 12 12 4M6 4h6v6"></path></svg></a></div></article><article class="fun-fact-card"><span aria-hidden="true" class="fun-fact-icon">★</span><div><p>Ia pernah mendorong agar elektrifikasi di Jambi tidak berhenti di tingkat desa, tetapi menjangkau dusun-dusun.</p><a href="https://emedia.dpr.go.id/2025/06/24/komitmen-dukung-pembangunan-ebt-rocky-candra-elektrifikasi-di-jambi-harus-sampai-dusun/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Sumber: DPR RI <svg aria-hidden="true" class="external-arrow" focusable="false" viewbox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 12 12 4M6 4h6v6"></path></svg></a></div></article></div>
</section></div></div></section></main>
</BaseLayout>
